sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor CU as Customer
  actor SU as Support agent
  participant HS as Bank case screen (host service)
  participant ENG as Rule Engine
  participant CK as Cockpit
  actor RA as Credit risk analyst
  CU->>SU: Why was application APP-7781 declined?
  SU->>HS: open APP-7781
  alt host stored the decisionId
    HS->>ENG: GET /decisions/{id}/explain
    ENG-->>HS: Declined. Rule R4: monthly income 6,500,000 VND is below 8,000,000 VND
  else no decisionId stored
    SU->>CK: Decisions, filter by correlation id APP-7781 (M2) or by rule set and day (M1)
  end
  HS-->>SU: explanation, inputs masked
  SU-->>CU: reads the explanation
  opt needs the matched row
    SU->>CK: Open in cockpit link
    CK->>ENG: GET /decisions/{id}
    ENG-->>CK: version 3, row R4 highlighted, nationalId masked
  end
  opt customer disputes the outcome
    SU->>RA: ticket with decision link and correlationId
  end
